14:["$","div",null,{"className":"main-content","children":["$","$L18",null,{"hotels":[{"vendor_name":"Pavilions Collection","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Ultra-Stylish Airlie Beach Apartment Escape Near the Waterfront","description":"Experience a sun-kissed Whitsundays escape with a boutique apartment stay at Pavilions Collection, a stylish waterfront base in the heart of lively Airlie Beach. Ideally located only moments from Main Beach and the Coral Sea Marina, each modern, self-contained apartment offers a tranquil retreat for those looking to spend their days discovering the stunning Whitsundays and the UNESCO World Heritage-listed Great Barrier Reef. Apartments are situated in an elegant complex with multiple dining venues, so you won't need to look far for your pre-beach caffeine fix or sunset dinner. After a day of exploring, head upstairs to Paradiso Rooftop Bar & Restaurant and enjoy a cocktail or two with a view.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":327,"original_price":327,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000005JeClAAK","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/3hmt031mbg1g223djmn","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/vimodpjl19c1fqmszqs","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/wbo79l146rkae8cx05yih","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":2,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Club Wyndham Airlie Beach","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Airlie Beach Apartment-Style Resort with Ocean Views & Outdoor Pool","description":"Find yourself in tropical paradise at the gateway to the Whitsundays at Club Wyndham Airlie Beach. With apartments peering over the glistening lagoon, Tropical North Queensland is on your doorstep, with just an hour on the ferry between you and Hamilton Island. But life at Airlie is just as sweet; swim laps of the pool as you look onto the crimson sunset, dine at Tides at Airlie Beach with ocean-fresh seafood on offer, and enjoy some of the area's best portside views.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":270,"original_price":270,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000Ez3OeAAJ","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/mqv6h3wksel69x7lgr7g","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/vlfvvd4sxghl6brvmm5","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/bjhquh28kvuexy8kyk34","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 2","min_duration":2,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"The Boathouse Apartments","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Stylish Airlie Beach Apartment Escape for up to Seven Guests with Views of the Whitsundays","description":"Overlooking the Port of Airlie Marina and the dazzling waters of the Coral Sea, The Boathouse Apartments offers a stylish apartment stay in the vibrant heart of Airlie Beach and places you within easy reach of the Whitsundays. After days spent exploring the town’s famed collection of boutiques, cafes and golden beaches, return to your fully furnished seaside retreat to enjoy a resort-style swimming pool, heated hot tub, or even a spot of tennis on the full-sized court.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":266,"original_price":266,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000Do4fPAAR","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/0kdnrw8lcalbiha8x2o","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/ifhechgz6yijbqzhiy17","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/9smy4iuxc07sz3yacjqn6","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Yangaro","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Airlie Beach Luxury Villas Overlooking Funnel Bay with Onsite Day Spa","description":"Experience Airlie Beach, gateway to the Whitsundays with elevated creature comforts in an architecturally designed villa at Yangaro. Overlooking Funnel Bay, you'll have the best of the region at your doorstep including turquoise beaches, unparalled natural serenity and aquatic adventure aplenty. The Clubhouse fulfils every need from wellness paradise at the day spa to world-class fitness equipment. Plus, the area's ocean-fresh spoils are yours to uncover with many nearby dining options.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":1499,"original_price":1499,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000EeC0pAAF","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/me7j0wq5l44jhnw8no6r","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/pqxyu2axoforto9dr9ut","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/8f9g6n940jcys53j7087","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":3,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Mirage Whitsundays","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Boutique Airlie Beach Waterfront Apartment Escape with Two Pools, Spa & Onsite Restaurant","description":"Indulge in the tropical allure of Queensland with a seaside stay at this self-contained apartment retreat, perfectly placed along the turquoise shores of the Coral Sea. A short stroll from the vibrant Airlie Beach, savour fresh seafood at the onsite restaurant, take a dip in the resort's adults-only Horizon Pool or indulge in some family fun in the Lagoon Pool. For a spot of thrill, embark on a sailing adventure to the Great Barrier Reef, snorkel around the Whitsunday Islands or take a scenic flight over the stunning Heart Reef. After a day of exploration, return to your serene abode and pamper yourself with relaxing treatments at the Satori Day Spa.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":342,"original_price":342,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000GvFwsAAF","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/wk2takl0oqd97shxh6ue","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/v6ul24kcid182ggb2qc","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/zm4z0rvmdjb0ljecnln","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 2","min_duration":2,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Mantra Club Croc","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Laidback Airlie Beach Escape with Lagoon Pool & Onsite Bistro","description":"Experience the tropical allure of the Whitsundays with a stay at this charming retreat nestled in the heart of Airlie Beach. Behind the traditional Queenslander facade lies modern amenities for a comfortable and stylish escape, with a lagoon-style pool and lush, landscaped gardens. Dine on locally sourced seafood at the onsite bistro, or sip on a refreshing cocktail at the bar. Explore the vibrant Airlie Beach Lagoon, the bustling Saturday Markets, or set sail to the Great Barrier Reef from the nearby marina.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":94,"original_price":94,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y00000JReukAAD","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/lw1n7kpnfmch5gz7zx1e","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/tsooj1mugrtk46nkyvw","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/3mm36xkmrdc31cd5qa1ui","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2050-12-31 12:59:00"},{"vendor_name":"Freedom Shores","offer_country_name":"Australia","location_heading":"Airlie Beach","title":"Boutique Whitsundays Bungalow Boat Escape","description":"Set your sights on a one-of-a-kind stay in paradise at Freedom Shores, where you can sleep in a boat-inspired bungalow with the added luxury of ultra-modern comforts. If you are a fan of all things unique - and nautical - you will absolutely love this escape right by the water on the outskirts of Airlie Beach and boasting spectacular views over the Coral Sea. Be the captain of your own ship and enjoy a taste of life at sea without having to leave dry land, allowing you to take in the superb views or explore the Whitsundays and surrounding islands at your own pace. Feel immediately rejuvenated as you relax by the water or explore beyond the property and spend days exploring this exceptional part of the world, from the palm-fringed Airlie Beach to the stunning Whitsunday islands that lie in the Great Barrier Reef, one of the Seven Natural Wonders of the World.","location_subheading":"Australia","price":133,"original_price":133,"discount_percentage":0,"link":"https://luxuryescapes.com/offer/0062y000005JyFmAAK","hero_image":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/rakam3khf8a6s7ujbtme","image_two":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/tr7rw9ovqg6yiu4pr3i","image_three":"https://images.luxuryescapes.com/5opz4j6zv8iwx4st4zib","deal_tier":"Luxury Escapes - Tier 3","min_duration":1,"end_date_utc":"2026-12-31 12:59:00"}],"lang":"en"}]}]
